Hello Deepali
There are several kinds of covariate. I assume from your example that you are talking about spatial covariates of density. These are 'mask' covariates. Their input is covered in the documents secr-habitatmasks.pdf <https://www.otago.ac.nz/density/pdfs/secr-habitatmasks.pdf> and secr-densitysurfaces.pdf <https://www.otago.ac.nz/density/pdfs/secr-densitysurfaces.pdf> available from the Density website.
Murray

