That code works for me. Perhaps you are using an old version of secrdesign (tho' I'm not sure that would explain it)?

I used poplist <- list(list(model2D = "IHP", D = "D1", core = msk)).

Note there's no need to set nrepeats because that defaults to 1.

Murray

